    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HERMIONE: Not long.\nBELLATRIX: Show me.",
      "BELLATRIX: This sword is meant to be in my vault at Gringotts. How did you get it?\nHERMIONE: I don’t know what you’re talking about.\nBELLATRIX: Liar. What else did you take?",
      "BELLATRIX: I’m going to ask you once again: what else did you and your friends take from my vault!\nHERMIONE: I told you. I don’t know what you’re talking --",
      "FLEUR: This is the closest I could find to what you described, Hermione.\nHERMIONE: It’s perfect. Thank you, Fleur.",
      "LUNA: The lost diadem of Ravenclaw? Hasn’t anyone ever heard of it? It’s quite famous.\nCHO: Yes, but Luna, it’s lost. For centuries now. There’s not a person alive today who’s seen it."
    ]
